    "legend": "<p>Breast tissue with lobular neoplasia encompassing both atypical lobular hyperplasia and&nbsp;lobular carcinoma in situ&nbsp;(classic pattern). Radial scars, collagenous spherulosis and scattered calcifications are also seen.</p>",
